        <mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#2c5356&quot;&gt;7. DASHBOARD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;• Progress actual, plan, deviasi, hari berjalan, forecast selesai, total biaya&lt;br&gt;• Kurva S total (plan vs actual) dan Kurva S tiap unit&lt;br&gt;• Progress per unit&lt;br&gt;• Daftar &lt;b&gt;Yang perlu dilengkapi&lt;/b&gt;, lengkap dengan siapa yang harus mengisi&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;View: v_capaian_scope, v_capaian_unit, v_progress_project&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f2f8f7;strokeColor=#3d6f73;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="1830" width="452" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#2c5356&quot;&gt;8. LAPORAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;• Manpower: masa join, area-unit, man-hour harian&lt;br&gt;• Biaya: per unit, per area, total project&lt;br&gt;• Summary plan; plan vs actual running; plan vs actual close&lt;br&gt;• Simpan report / summary; unduh Excel dan PDF&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;View: v_jam_kerja_manpower, v_biaya_manpower_unit, v_biaya_proyek&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#444444&quot; style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Tabel: saved_reports&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f2f8f7;strokeColor=#3d6f73;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
